        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {\\text {②} f (t) = e ^ {- 2 t} u (t)} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\Rightarrow y _ {z i} (t) = A _ {1} e ^ {- t} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} \\Rightarrow y _ {z s} (t) = A _ {3} e ^ {- t} + A _ {4} e ^ {- 2 t} + B t e ^ {- 2 t}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
