        "type": "text",
        "text": "以 $y''(t)+3y'(t)+2y(t)=f'(t)+f(t),f(t)=e^{-3t}u(t),y(0_{-})=1,y'(0_{-})=1$ 为例：",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            107,
            826,
            151
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)由方程可列 $y_{zi}(t)$ 的形式为：",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            156,
            423,
            175
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "代入 $y^{(k)}(0_{-})$ 值后可得:",
        "bbox": [
            156,
            201,
            367,
            221
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left. \\begin{array}{l} y _ {z i} (t) = A _ {1} e ^ {- t} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} \\\\ y _ {z i} (t) = (e ^ {- t} - 2 e ^ {- 2 t}) u (t) \\end{array} \\right\\} \\text {时} y _ {z i}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            380,
            176,
            792,
            254
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)由方程和激励可列 $y_{zs}(t)$ 的形式为:",
        "bbox": [
            148,
            263,
            485,
            280
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {y _ {z s} (t) = A _ {3} e ^ {- 3 t} + A _ {4} e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t}} \\\\ & {H (s) = \\frac {\\text {右边}}{\\text {左边}} = \\frac {s + 1}{s ^ {2} + 3 s + 2} = \\frac {s + 1}{(s + 1) (s + 2)} = \\frac {1}{(s + 2)}} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow Y _ {z s} (s) = H (s) \\cdot F (s) = \\frac {1}{(s + 2)} \\cdot \\frac {1}{(s + 3)}} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow y _ {z s} (t) = (e ^ {- 2 t} - e ^ {- 3 t}) u (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            258,
